license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  CoFailMed measures shared failures in medical-segmentation pools using
  aligned per-case Dice scores. The primary study evaluates 11 pretrained
  encoders, 4 readout seeds and 5 tasks, with frozen features and separately
  trained 1x1 convolutional readouts. The release contains the aligned
  per-case Dice traces, split identifiers, analysis scripts with reference
  outputs, and the study implementation.
keywords:
  - medical image segmentation
  - foundation models
  - model ensembles
  - correlated failures
  - effective pool size
  - evaluation
